# Window resize flicker

**Owner:** Bob. **Status:** fixed 21 Oct.

When resizing from the bottom-right corner, the window contents flashed white for a frame on every size change, especially in the Files app.

Cause: the app view re-created its virtual list on every `ResizeObserver` callback, briefly rendering an empty container.

Fix: the view keeps its list and only updates the viewport height; ResizeObserver callbacks are batched to one per frame. Also set the window background to the theme surface colour so any gap is not white.

Checked in both light and dark themes and with reduce-transparency on.
